%p Select one creator from the creator list to be the long-term primary contact. This person generally carries ultimate responsibility for dataset validity and is often a faculty member or principal investigator.
%p If there is only one creator, select that creator.
%p You will need to provide an email address for every creator. When the dataset is deposited, all creators receive a confirmation email.
